The chart displays the daily trend of impressions for Campaign CMP_2025_0011, focusing on the 'Consideration' objective. The x-axis represents the date, and the y-axis shows the impressions. This line chart allows for easy observation of fluctuations and overall trends in daily impressions over the specified period.\",\n        \"db_text\": null,\n        \"ds_text\": null\n    },\n    \"prompt6\": {\n        \"prompt\": \"please provide a daily trend visualization of total ad spend for campaign id cmp 2025 0011 for ben & jerry's, focusing on the 'consideration' objective.\",\n        \"chart_url\": \"gs://acn-cda-adk-staging/root/user/ae810cb7-5080-4f7d-9871-9133e9fec64b/please_provide_a_daily_trend_visualization_of_total_ad_spend_for_campaign_id_cmp_2025_0011_for_ben_&_jerry's,_focusing_on_the_'consideration'_objective._VizChart.png/0\",\n        \"json_data\": \"gs://acn-cda-adk-staging/root/user/ae810cb7-5080-4f7d-9871-9133e9fec64b/please_provide_a_daily_trend_visualization_of_total_ad_spend_for_campaign_id_cmp_2025_0011_for_ben_&_jerry's,_focusing_on_the_'consideration'_objective._data.json/0\",\n        \"viz_text\": \"The chart illustrates the daily trend of Total Ad Spend for Campaign ID CMP_2025_0011. The X-axis represents the date, and the Y-axis shows the daily spend in dollars. The line chart clearly depicts how the ad spend fluctuates over time, allowing for easy identification of peaks and troughs in daily expenditures for the specified campaign.\\n\\nLet me know if you would like to analyze specific periods or metrics in more detail!\",\n        \"db_text\": null,\n        \"ds_text\": null\n    },\n    \"prompt7\": {\n        \"prompt\": \"please provide a concise summary of the overall performance for campaign id cmp 2025 0011 for ben & jerry's, highlighting key kpi performance, any observed anomalies, and significant trends.\",\n        \"chart_url\": null,\n        \"json_data\": null,\n        \"viz_text\": null,\n        \"db_text\": null,\n        \"ds_text\": \"This campaign for Ben & Jerry's, 'CMP_2025_0011', demonstrated strong performance across several key metrics:\\n\\n**Key Performance Indicators (KPIs):**\\n\\n*   **Impressions:** 98,838\\n*   **Clicks:** 1,306\\n*   **Conversions:** 139\\n*   **Total Daily Spend:** $1,461.21\\n*   **Attributed Sales Value:** $12,052.62\\n*   **Click-Through Rate (CTR):** 1.39%\\n*   **Conversion Rate:** 10.89%\\n*   **Return on Ad Spend (ROAS):** 9.09\\n*   **Cost Per Click (CPC):** $0.99\\n*   **Cost Per Acquisition (CPA):** $9.74\\n*   **Add-to-Cart Events:** 4,706\\n*   **New-to-Brand Conversions:** 52\\n*   **Average Dwell Time:** 35 seconds\\n\\n**Overall Performance Summary:**\\n\\nThe campaign generated a substantial attributed sales value of $12,052.62 against a daily spend of $1,461.21, resulting in a healthy ROAS of 9.09. This indicates a very positive return on investment. The CTR of 1.39% suggests decent engagement with the ads, leading to 1,306 clicks. The high conversion rate of 10.89% is particularly noteworthy, showing that a significant portion of users who clicked ultimately converted. The CPA of $9.74 seems efficient given the sales value generated. Furthermore, the campaign successfully drove engagement beyond just purchases, with 4,706 add-to-cart events and attracted 52 new customers, contributing to brand growth. The average dwell time of 35 seconds also suggests good content engagement.\"\n    },\n    \"prompt8\": {\n        \"prompt\": \"could you please provide the comprehensive details for campaign id cmp 2025 0011 for ben & jerry's, including its unique campaign names, unique campaign ad ids, category, media types, channels, objective, sub-objective, campaign duration, unique plan\",\n        \"chart_url\": null,\n        \"json_data\": null,\n        \"viz_text\": null,\n        \"db_text\": \"{\\n \\\"explain\\\": \\\"1. The user requested comprehensive details for Campaign ID 'CMP_2025_0011' for 'Ben & Jerry''s', including campaign names, unique campaign ad IDs, category, media types, channels, objective, sub-objective, campaign duration, unique planned spend, and daily total actual spend.\\\\n2. I used the `initial_bq_nl2sql` tool to generate a SQL query. The tool identified that the required information could be retrieved from a materialized view named `mv_flat_campaign_measurement_1`.\\\\n3. The generated SQL query selected the campaign ID, a comma-separated list of unique campaign ad group IDs (interpreted as unique campaign ad IDs), objective, sub-objective, media type, channels, start date, end date, planned spend (mapped from `cm_budget` in the materialized view), and the sum of daily actual spend (mapped from `cp_daily_spend` in the materialized view).\\\\n4. The query filtered the results for the specified `campaign_id` ('CMP_2025_0011') and `brand_name` ('Ben & Jerry''s').\\\\n5. The results were grouped by all non-aggregated selected columns to ensure correct aggregation of the total actual spend.\\\\n6. The generated SQL query was then validated using `run_bigquery_validation`, which confirmed its syntax and successful execution against the BigQuery database.\\\",\\n \\\"sql\\\": \\\"SELECT\\\\n    t.cp_campaign_id AS campaign_id,\\\\n    STRING_AGG(DISTINCT t.cm_campaign_ad_grp_id) AS unique_campaign_ad_ids,\\\\n    t.cm_objective AS objective,\\\\n    t.cm_sub_objective AS sub_objective,\\\\n    t.cm_media_type AS media_type,\\\\n    t.cm_channels AS channels,\\\\n    t.cm_start_date AS start_date,\\\\n    t.cm_end_date AS end_date,\\\\n    t.cm_budget AS planned_spend,\\\\n    SUM(t.cp_daily_spend) AS total_actual_spend\\\\nFROM\\\\n    `acn-cda.RMN_Campaign_Dataset_Dev_MV.mv_flat_campaign_measurement_1` AS t\\\\nWHERE\\\\n    t.cp_campaign_id = 'CMP_2025_0011'\\\\n    AND t.cp_brand_name = \\\\\\\"Ben & Jerry's\\\\\\\"\\\\nGROUP BY\\\\n    t.cp_campaign_id,\\\\n    t.cm_objective,\\\\n    t.cm_sub_objective,\\\\n    t.cm_media_type,\\\\n    t.cm_channels,\\\\n    t.cm_start_date,\\\\n    t.cm_end_date,\\\\n    t.cm_budget\\\\nLIMIT 500\\\",\\n \\\"sql_results\\\": [\\n  {\\n   \\\"campaign_id\\\": \\\"CMP_2025_0011\\\",\\n   \\\"channels\\\": \\\"Onsite\\\",\\n   \\\"end_date\\\": \\\"2025-07-04\\\",\\n   \\\"media_type\\\": \\\"Sponsored Product\\\",\\n   \\\"objective\\\": \\\"Consideration\\\",\\n   \\\"planned_spend\\\": 8780.87,\\n   \\\"start_date\\\": \\\"2025-06-12\\\",\\n   \\\"sub_objective\\\": \\\"Engagement / Clicks\\\",\\n   \\\"total_actual_spend\\\": 1680.3900000000003,\\n   \\\"unique_campaign_ad_ids\\\": \\\"CMP_2025_0011_ADGRP_02\\\"\\n  }\\n ],\\n \\\"nl_results\\\": \\\"The campaign 'CMP_2025_0011' for Ben & Jerry's has the following details:\\\\n- **Campaign ID:** CMP_2025_0011\\\\n- **Unique Campaign Ad IDs:** CMP_2025_0011_ADGRP_02\\\\n- **Objective:** Consideration\\\\n- **Sub-objective:** Engagement / Clicks\\\\n- **Media Type:** Sponsored Product\\\\n- **Channels:** Onsite\\\\n- **Campaign Duration:** From 2025-06-12 to 2025-07-04\\\\n- **Planned Spend:** 8780.87\\\\n- **Total Actual Spend:** 1680.39\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\",\n        \"ds_text\": null\n    }\n}"